<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>ONLY WORKS on 90FOV</Major>
    <Description>Rapid fires sar shots essentially making the sar an automatic weapon, there is a small limit on time inbetween shots so it is not 100% automatic but it still shoots pretty fast

98/99% accuracy, no one can hit shots at 100% acuracy at all times so this is needed to prevent you from 1. getting reported and 2.getting banned

You can set sensativity from 0.88-0.9 but 0.89 is recomended DPI set to 800

the FOV must remain at 90 or the macro will NOT work at all

Must be 2560 x 1440p or any 16:9 aspect ratio resolution

have fun!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
